      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRENCH BLONDE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Mt Gambier behind Saint Ella (18.03) in a TG1-4W. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form out of her last race has been franked. Can measure up this time. SOLAR TESS (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (22.92) in a T3 Grade 6 at Ballarat. Form from her last run is proving strong. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. OCEAN AMANDA (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.00) in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. In the mix. PETEY BALE (7) can feature with the right run.",
